{
  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-raster-resampling:\n\n- Supports raster resolution change using nearest neighbor, bilinear, and cubic convolution methods (numpy-based implementation).\n- Preserves geographic extent while resampling, with customized nodata handling to avoid value contamination.\n- Accepts both local GeoTIFF input and synthetic test raster generation.\n- Outputs include a resampled GeoTIFF (float32, EPSG:4326) and a statistics manifest in JSON.\n- Fully local processing; no data is uploaded, and synthetic mode is network-free.\n- Command-line interface with usage examples for varied workflows.",
